{
  "_readme": [
    "Source registry for import_smriti.py. One block per DGE grantha folder.",
    "",
    "Every layer carries an explicit `rights` value:",
    "  pd            - pre-1930 print edition or an ancient text; safe to redistribute",
    "  cc-by         - explicit Creative Commons grant by the transcriber",
    "  encumbered    - derived from a modern critical edition; NOT imported unless",
    "                  --include-encumbered is passed. Kept in the file on purpose so",
    "                  the decision is visible rather than lost.",
    "",
    "`gdoc` layers use the UT-Austin / Olivelle Dharmasastra transcriptions",
    "(https://sites.utexas.edu/sanskrit/resources/dharmasastra/). Where a doc id is",
    "not pinned below, run with --discover-gdocs and the importer will scrape the hub",
    "page and match by link text rather than guessing an id."
  ],

  "gdoc_hub": "https://sites.utexas.edu/sanskrit/resources/dharmasastra/",

